  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "532b1c24-fecd-4f65-b802-dfc3404d2f00"],
 ", a message to ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  StyleBox["b", "TI"]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "992ac840-37e7-4ecc-95ab-d83f4b49b630"],
 " returned to ",
 Cell[BoxData[
